A stunning narrative experience that challenges the form unlike anything else before it. Davey Wreden (known for writing the 2011 experimental game
) is perhaps the first truly great storyteller that has chosen video games as their medium. Featuring gorgeous abstract and surreal environments and a beautiful ambient soundscape for a soundtrack,
is a profoundly moving experience that I highly recommend.

My favourite arcade racing game with advanced demolishion physic. If you fan of demolishion derby or flatout you really should try this game. Remember it is pre-alpha not even beta of this game!
Pros:
- Physics!!! one of best i ever seen in racing game;
- Many diffrent tracks and customization options like weather;
- Tons of cars you can buy and use;
- Sound of engine <3;
- Good optimization;
- Leveling and crew managment;
- If you buy this game now you get extra game for free (throw a santa and sneak a peak 2.0);
- 23 players in single race;
- Amazing multiplayer mode!
Cons:
- Once game crashed in my PC;
- Stupid AI;
- Hidden walls;
- No music;
- No achivmenets.
My note is strong 8/10

Hello,
I do not give negative reviews ( I try to make do with what I have), but this game... is running at 7 FPS instantly (from the menu). There is no fix from the developer or any warning that this might happen. I suspect its from the nvidia physx. If you found a fix please tell me! It's sad to give a bad review just because the game is running bad (for some people) because I might have enjoyed the gameplay. Now I have to waste time trying to fix your game (yes you developer!) and write down this review. This propblem is known from the launch of the game and guess what, its been 2 years and nobody did anything about this. ( if you could confirm its the physx then add a f******* disable button ingame )
Things I have tried:
-installing older/new nvdia physx drivers;
-running in compatability mode both game and steam;
-disabling/enabling Vsync;
-checking game files integrity;
-lowering resolution to 720p to both desktop and game (windowed/fulscreen).
PC specs:
FX 8150 @ 4.2 Ghz
AMD R9 Fury
12 GB DDR 3 1866

This is my first review, merelly based on my first try at the game (aprox: 30 minutes):
Pros:
+ Good and envolving atmosphere;
+ Accurate survival feeling;
+ Survive is challenging;
+ Has Achievements;
Cons:
- The time could be visible in the screen instead of in the Tab menu;
- Graphics and Textures could be better;
- The interface could be more practical.
This is my frist impression of the game. In my opinion it has a lot of potential to become a really good game. Can't wait for the final version!

A rare case of good combination between FPS and RPG.
Pros:
--> Amazing visual concept;
--> Excellent storyline;
--> Lots of guns and gadgets;
--> Creepy enviroment.
Cons:
--> Too many stuff to choose from when equipping yourself for battles;
--> The story is often really ♥♥♥♥ing sad. A real downer. Be advised.

