Fans of Gauntlet would go and by Gauntlet, cus it's more casual aaaaaand a tonn cheaper. And i personaly think - more interesting...
No Pros found, game is total crap. So much crap that it even forced me to go anв write my review about it. I think it should be illegal to sell such crap without refund.
Total of Cons:
