Delirious combat system (hello xbox or wherever it was ported from for f**** sake go kill yourselves you lazy developers...);
Irritating dialogs and cutscenes. No, really. Probably devs thought it will be funny. But it is not, it is stupid, and - as you can't get away from it - it is irritating...;
Jezuschrist... Moneywaist...;

