Yoooo, zup? :D
Well, gotta say that i beat every level and got every achievement in something like 20 minutes. It's kinda weird but it's just like that. Anyways it's really fun to play, that's for sure.
You will understand it when you start playing. I found some achievements kinda funny, i mean, the way you get them.
PROS:
- Not boring at all;
- Good value;
- Nice artwork;
- Pretty fun;
- Good puzzles;
After you play this game you'll want to buy the other Zup's as i did.
I hope they keep doing more games like this, i'm ready for Zup 6,7,8,9 and Infinite :D
MY RATING: 10/10
